  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Transport",
      "items": [
        "Source creation, state reads and SSE traverse the Vercel proxy in production. Upload and replay bypass the proxy using the public origin returned by /api/runtime. Bearer authorization is sent on both paths."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Ordering, not measured duration",
      "items": [
        "The SSE connection already exists while analysis runs; this timeline groups its consumption after worker writes for clarity. The worker repeats frame writes and progress events until completion. Replay is returned only once completed and ready."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Real failure branches",
      "items": [
        "Empty/oversized/unsupported uploads are rejected and partial uploads removed. Conflicting active jobs return 409. Cancelled/failed analyses may be retried from the original; process restart requeues interrupted work. A candidate is conditional, so a recording can finish without any incident."
      ]
    }
  ]
